{"id":"n38377-1-7","stage":5,"title":"끔찍이 · 厉害","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38377-1-7-1","ko":"민준이는 뱃멀미를 심하게 하지?","zh":"敏俊是不是很容易晕船？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"뱃멀미를","meaning":"晕船","explanation":"뱃멀미：晕船；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뱃멀미","audio":"/audio/aa618f705836a05e2db6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58750","senseId":"1","lemma":"뱃멀미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뱃멀미를","audio":"/audio/f8b9c14b97dfdd6120c6.mp3"}},{"text":"심하게","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심하게","audio":"/audio/a0eb6ba7ecd04f6ef86b.mp3"}},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aa618f705836a05e","term":"뱃멀미","zh":"晕船","audio":"/audio/aa618f705836a05e2db6.mp3","entryId":"58750","definition":"船体晃动引起的头晕、恶心、呕吐的症状。","pronunciation":["밴멀미"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e54bd8f1dc27be3acbf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38377-1-7-2","ko":"응. 그래서 배 타는 일을 아주 끔찍이 여겨.","zh":"对。所以他极其讨厌坐船。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"배","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}},{"text":"타는","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타는","audio":"/audio/798479a558d3170caf71.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"끔찍이","meaning":"厉害，不得了，没法说","explanation":"끔찍이：厉害，不得了，没法说。","readings":[{"term":"끔찍이","audio":"/audio/4809d3f46c7602a9a8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38377","senseId":"1","lemma":"끔찍이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끔찍이","audio":"/audio/4809d3f46c7602a9a8fb.mp3"}},{"text":"여겨.","meaning":"认为，看作","explanation":"여기다：认为，看作；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"여기다","audio":"/audio/9fbf41bfac29c1213aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15205","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여겨","audio":"/audio/8e62ff61565448a337d3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"船","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"29729","definition":"运载人或东西，在水上行驶的交通工具。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"4809d3f46c7602a9","term":"끔찍이","zh":"厉害，不得了，没法说","audio":"/audio/4809d3f46c7602a9a8fb.mp3","entryId":"38377","definition":"看上去过度而令人惊讶。","pronunciation":["끔찌기"]},{"id":"9fbf41bfac29c121","term":"여기다","zh":"认为，看作","audio":"/audio/9fbf41bfac29c1213aa5.mp3","entryId":"15205","definition":"心中将某对象想成什么或想成怎样。","pronunciation":["여기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d59c01d41848e63b5a5f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],